        "cheatsheets": [
          { "id": "cs-nmap", "title": "Nmap Cheatsheet", "content": "## Nmap Essential Flags\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-sS` | SYN scan (stealth) |\n| `-sT` | TCP connect scan |\n| `-sU` | UDP scan |\n| `-sV` | Version detection |\n| `-O` | OS detection |\n| `-A` | Aggressive (OS + version + scripts + traceroute) |\n| `-sn` | Ping sweep (no port scan) |\n| `-Pn` | Skip host discovery |\n| `-p-` | All 65535 ports |\n| `--script vuln` | Run vulnerability scripts |\n| `-oN/-oX/-oG` | Output: Normal/XML/Grepable |\n\n## Common Scans\n```bash\nnmap -sS -sV -O -p- target\nnmap --script=http-enum target\nnmap -sU --top-ports 20 target\n```" },
          { "id": "cs-metasploit", "title": "Metasploit Cheatsheet", "content": "## Metasploit Framework\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `msfconsole` | Start Metasploit |\n| `search <term>` | Search for exploits |\n| `use <module>` | Select a module |\n| `show options` | Display module options |\n| `set RHOSTS <ip>` | Set target IP |\n| `set PAYLOAD <payload>` | Set payload |\n| `exploit` / `run` | Execute the exploit |\n| `sessions -l` | List active sessions |\n| `sessions -i <id>` | Interact with session |\n\n## Post-Exploitation\n```\nmeterpreter > sysinfo\nmeterpreter > hashdump\nmeterpreter > upload/download\nmeterpreter > shell\n```" },
          { "id": "cs-webapp", "title": "Web App Testing Cheatsheet", "content": "## OWASP Top 10 Quick Reference\n\n1. **Broken Access Control** - IDOR, privilege escalation\n2. **Cryptographic Failures** - Weak encryption, plaintext storage\n3. **Injection** - SQLi, XSS, Command Injection\n4. **Insecure Design** - Missing threat modeling\n5. **Security Misconfiguration** - Default creds, verbose errors\n6. **Vulnerable Components** - Outdated libraries\n7. **Auth Failures** - Weak passwords, session fixation\n8. **Data Integrity** - Insecure deserialization\n9. **Logging Failures** - Missing audit trails\n10. **SSRF** - Server-Side Request Forgery\n\n## SQLi Payloads\n```\n' OR 1=1 --\n' UNION SELECT null,null,null --\n'; DROP TABLE users; --\n```\n\n## XSS Payloads\n```\n<script>alert(1)</script>\n<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>\n```" }
        ]
      },
